.Dd February 27, 2026
.Dt IR-NORMALIZE 1
.Os Substrate
.Sh NAME
.Nm ir-normalize
.Nd parse, verify, and emit canonical textual SSA IR
.Sh SYNOPSIS
.Nm
.Ar input.ir
.Sh DESCRIPTION
.Nm
reads an IR module, verifies it, and writes normalized serialized IR to
standard output for deterministic diffing/regression tests.
.Sh EXIT STATUS
.Bl -tag -width 2
.It 0
Normalization succeeded.
.It 1
Parse/verify/serialization failure.
.It 2
Invalid command usage.
.El
.Sh SEE ALSO
.Xr ir-verifier 1 ,
.Xr ir-diff 1 ,
.Xr cc 1
